# Example customer overlay — frontend brand (WL-8, ties to WL-1).
#
# PLACEHOLDERS ONLY. These are Vite build-time variables (only VITE_-prefixed
# vars are exposed to client code — see frontend/.env.example and
# frontend/src/brand.config.js, the one place a deployment's name and logo
# come from). Copy this directory to overlays/<name>/ (dropping the .example
# suffix), fill in every <...> value, and `copy` the result to
# `frontend/.env.local` before building the SPA.
#
# If the customer supplies their own mark, also drop it into
# frontend/public/ (SVG only — WL-13, no raster images in this repo) and
# point VITE_BRAND_LOGO / VITE_BRAND_FAVICON at it, as shown below.

VITE_BRAND_NAME=<Customer Name> Tax Credit Copilot
VITE_BRAND_SHORT_NAME=<short name, e.g. CTC>
VITE_BRAND_LOGO=/brand-mark-<customer>.svg
VITE_BRAND_FAVICON=/brand-mark-<customer>.svg
